/WL_745_Familienweg_Lenzerheide_3_g.jpg","foto_standard":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_745_Familienweg_Lenzerheide_3_s.jpg","foto_small":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-small/WL_745_Familienweg_Lenzerheide_3_k.jpg","foto_abstract":null,"logo":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/WL_745_GR_RGB_140x140.jpg","logo_svg":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-svg/WL_745_GR.svg","x_coordinate":761043.0893602372,"y_coordinate":178439.11316958192,"description":"The panoramic tour begins in the centre of Lenzerheide and first passes through the famous Eichhörnchenwald (“squirrel forest”). With a little luck, you’ll spot a few of the cute creatures. You then go around the Heidsee lake anticlockwise. You have views across the lake, of the surrounding forests and the striking peaks that frame the valley floor.\n\nAfter the lake, the path climbs gradually. Shortly after the Seehof hotel, it turns off and takes you up through the forest to Alp Spoina. The panoramic view over the Lenzerheide valley becomes more magnificent as you climb higher. When you reach the Alp, the contrast between the farmed land and the surrounding mountains is clearly visible.\n\nFrom here, the path takes you back down into the valley. You have changing views of the mountain scenery and the village along the way. The tour ends back in the centre of Lenzerheide.\n\nIt combines different types of landscape over a relatively short distance: the idyllic forest, the sparkling lake, the scenic Alp and the vibrant village. It brings together brief, Alpine sections with easy passages by the water and is therefore a perfect striking circular hike in the heart of the holiday region of Lenzerheide.","length":9,"length_asphalt":null,"length_unsurfaced":null,"length_singletrail":null,"height_difference":300,"height_difference_back":280,"height_downwards":null,"hiking_time":2.5833333,"hiking_time_back":2.5833333,"category_grade":"easy","category_grade_text":"hiking trail","category_grade_skiing":null,"